OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few clear
OL,6,Fspells across the northwest. Otherwise
OL,7,Fit will be a mainly cloudy evening and
OL,8,Fnight with one or two light showers.
OL,9,FLight easterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CFriday:FA rather cloudy day with a few
OL,12,Flight showers, but many places will
OL,13,Fremain dry. Some light rain likely to
OL,14,Fspread north through the evening.
OL,15,FLight winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCloudy
OL,18,Fwith a chance of showers on Saturday.
OL,19,FThen becoming dry with variable
OL,20,Famounts of cloud. Overnight low cloud
OL,21,Fand fog.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
